<title>USA: RehabCare sees Q3 EPS $0.36-$0.37/shr.</title>
<headline>RehabCare sees Q3 EPS $0.36-$0.37/shr.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>RehabCare Group Inc said Thursday it expects to report earnings for the third quarter ended November 30 of $0.36-$0.37 a share, up from $0.31 a share a year ago.</p>
<p>Revenues are expected to have been $31-32 million in the quarter, compared to $22 million a year ago, said James Usden, chief executive of the rehabilitation care staffing company.</p>
<p>Earnings for the third quarter will be reported in the week of January 6-10, a delay due to holiday schedules, he said in a news release.</p>
<p>RehabCare shares rose 3/8 to 19 Thursday.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787)).</p>
